{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "5f6632555689742f8d9af3524ee9c90aa0d1df6701cba4d62063982ee3781e3d", "ja": "どんな『わたし』にでも", "zh": "无论怎样的“我”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "caecf518f5d30ed0998068f09cb779e3578ed03f70c5a193e00812818fafdff1", "ja": "熱の入った稽古をするメンバー。陰で心配\nするより稽古の時間を作ったほうがいいと\n気付いたプロデューサーは、練習後に星梨花\nを呼ぶ。演技が上手くなっている事を褒め\nられた星梨花は、ホッとした表情を見せる。", "zh": "成员们投入地进行排练。与其在暗中担心，\n制作人意识到不如抽出时间排练，于是在练习后\n叫来了星梨花。被夸奖演技有所进步的星梨花，\n露出了放心的表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "264d0353078e226dc48917057431c8a70de8d1b36ef4ad358d935a8a8658f624", "ja": "（レッスンを開始して1週間。みんな、\n熱の入った取り組みを見せているが……）", "zh": "（开始练习已经1周了。大家都投入了十足的热情，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "cfaf2919f6cc637b5416ddeb780e2ad9693115ff0524fc335ce46f8bdf3547f5", "ja": "みなさん、いったんストップです～。\n今のシーン、すこし見直しますよ～。", "zh": "各位，先暂停一下哦～\n我们稍微复盘一下刚才的场景哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "a2c61e04113bf38b3a1fac659ebcee89952cad472432c7af6482165a8b7dcffe", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、台詞にミスがありましたね～。\n気付いていたとは思いますが、念のため。", "zh": "星梨花，台词有一处错误呢～。\n我想你应该已经注意到了，不过为了保险起见还是提醒一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "edcfdfc139942cfa079dad1b2859812790b15b286359f6a2343fdf1ee90805ab", "ja": "それと、立ち位置を目で確認しすぎていますね～。\n癖になるとよくないので、今から気をつけましょう～。", "zh": "另外，你太过频繁地用眼睛确认站位了呢～。\n要是养成习惯可不好，所以从现在开始注意吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "8a563fe45bd9ed832e3693ba51ab721cc4008cea5e8c067d28f8f77413ebb939", "ja": "は、はい！　台詞も立ち位置も\nちゃんと頭に入れないと、ですよね……。", "zh": "是、是！台词和站位也必须好好记在脑子里才行，对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "fe675e98125d0ea114f5f2eb1b02a0eb49fba8ec1ef445779d71546689913f13", "ja": "主演って、とにかく出番が多いからね～。\n茜ちゃんも経験者だからね、わかるよ……！", "zh": "主演嘛，总之戏份很多呢～。小茜也是有经验的人，所以能理解……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "d01c4335d5065ded36cfb212629516586f625a4a9ff9c1013469401cfcab99a6", "ja": "演技だけじゃなくて、歌もダンスもあるし、\n無理せずひとつずつこなしていけば……。", "zh": "不光要演戏，还要唱歌跳舞，\n别勉强自己，一件件完成就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "9fe12d745c737125943857cc5a5bcddb29fac89b5b876fc1f9f6db6da96d3ed3", "ja": "いえ！　わたし、大丈夫です！\nもっと厳しくお願いします！", "zh": "不！我没事！\n请再严格一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "4732d3c9b12654c0ee45ca1af2fcaa8a285b490fdc2125b4fb9652ace9c847e5", "ja": "そうですね～。私も、この役を引き継いだ以上、\n腑抜けた演技をするつもりはありません……。", "zh": "是啊～既然我也接下了这个角色，就不会敷衍了事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "92c46ef264d8416b02717753803a4880d0574b7ea5a995ee2743c8ccac68223a", "ja": "星梨花ちゃんの希望通り……\nここからは遠慮なく、ビシバシいきますからね～。", "zh": "按照星梨花的期望……\n接下来我可就不客气，要狠狠地严格要求你了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "2664843bd4c3c3914ce278c3266ecad1a1aa8ad5c229a6ba3d38558837450de1", "ja": "はい、大丈夫です！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "是的，没问题！\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "858c2eb65affcd4075849fc624af4b8f3776c9cd9813f97be16789e4e78c0376", "ja": "ま、まさかこのメンバーで熱血路線……？\n巻き込まれた茜ちゃんの運命やいかに！？", "zh": "难、难道要让这组成员走热血路线……？\n被卷进来的小茜命运究竟会如何！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "76d818a8cf85c8142bb4e7a1605722846acca1acc5ab1d8bcd84cb33bfbd706c", "ja": "もしかして、そろそろ俺の出番か……って、\n待ち構えてる？", "zh": "难道说，你正等着差不多该轮到我出场了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f3bf758d4b8c80f3d5d428f323b22197ba8eb3539a61ab0ce5d5aa75d8163f67", "ja": "！\nこのみさん、そういうわけでは……。", "zh": "！木实小姐，不是那回事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "22ad57d5004a437e3a925e08bdacf0db9a7c531313d517996a3d85f9efc5817d", "ja": "いえ、言い訳ですね。\nそうですね、心配してます。", "zh": "不，这算是借口吧。\n是啊，我很担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "5145f63199a950a15c2350c9ffa5e0bb45295377bf61b823b72cccc96bcedea9", "ja": "当然よね。特に星梨花ちゃんは、一幕を\nやりきった桃子ちゃんと、同じ役なんですもの。", "zh": "这也是理所当然的呢。更何况星梨花演的，\n还是和出色完成了第一幕演出的桃子相同的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8785a1a7fd6cbe713a50e4af31111ff68e69802de5f5e15a2d8629d967a0dae3", "ja": "はい。どうしてもプレッシャーはあるだろうと。\n……でも。", "zh": "是的。无论如何，肯定还是会有压力的吧。\n……不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "a4257553f062570d144a4df244308bd007b433f9850b9d4e3925f8dd572b48a0", "ja": "でも？", "zh": "但是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "2e78d9007b14bb2e41c7b615d557ca50cec969e999a6e010e7e8d742bb63d91b", "ja": "心配するよりも、星梨花達が思う存分\n稽古できる時間を作った方が、いいみたいです。", "zh": "与其瞎担心，不如多帮星梨花她们腾出\n能尽情排练的时间，看来这样更好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "3f415da560666eb75020139d202e8ffcefb35855cda133f1d5c2aacd8ba9ffcb", "ja": "そうね。私も同じ意見よ。\n星梨花ちゃん、きっと喜ぶわ。", "zh": "是啊，我也这么认为。星梨花一定会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "019b35f5023e90f1764b76564e3b95f478ff50aebc16dd6e6c14a9944402a54a", "ja": "後で本人に伝えます。\n今は、レッスンに集中させたいので……。", "zh": "我之后会转达给她本人的。\n因为现在想让她专心训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "9d7cf501bb3aadbbd964d0ed9747c1f2bd302b256d3560d67b64f49fa09cbc15", "ja": "ええ、そうしてあげて。\nみんな、今まさに成長中みたいだから♪", "zh": "嗯，就请你这么做吧。\n大家现在好像正处于成长阶段呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1024_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "9af0602fb1352c12e0d8d666a881aca80da67734bdf2c6943c4208823bd6528f", "ja": "あ、あの、{$P$}さん。\nわたしに、お話って……？", "zh": "啊、那个，{$P$}先生。\n您找我……有事要说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "1809debe331d1931398e9c8fe1944695eb1a17ca562bebbcc4d8fcbdbdb16b46", "ja": "ああ。さっき、芝居の稽古を覗かせてもらったんだ。\n星梨花、上手くなってるな！　目を見張ったよ。", "zh": "啊。刚才我去看了下戏剧排练。星梨花，你进步很大啊！真让我刮目相看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "0d6343c748c9377217a06515261416e29cfb681ccc5d7b1c24d9da58a2c06116", "ja": "もっと芝居の稽古に時間を割きたいだろ？　だから、\n直近のスケジュール調整を相談しようかと思って。", "zh": "你应该想把更多时间花在排练演戏上吧？所以，\n我在想要不要和你商量一下调整近期的日程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "bc7bc92747a2c2ed93e14803bb55d7ea3f174a9dd404f10c18727cec4ebb2285", "ja": "……。\nよ、よかったぁ……。", "zh": "……。\n太、太好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "e831dfc49caa0780bcfc467351d7c33379ba9013c47526aa33ad2c25e26fd7f7", "ja": "？　星梨花？", "zh": "？ 星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "e4cb665ee81975cc3bda88a4626d6a19e4a1e0b0afa6852fbe9091581616cbf4", "ja": "わたし、桃子ちゃんみたいに上手に\nお芝居できてないって、自分でもわかってたんです。", "zh": "我自己也明白，我没法像桃子那样把戏演得那么好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "1a124e63365351af785b3afccf8a53ce356926c13043362f99fed74d1e9280f2", "ja": "だから、もしかしたら\n役を交代するって言われるのかもって……。", "zh": "所以，我也在想，\n或许会被告知要更换角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8dfbef406df9746c3cf320edb91059ce595bedd29c0173b5d7691fec5b1210e2", "ja": "……安心してくれ。\n真珠星役を、星梨花から変更するつもりはないよ。", "zh": "……放心吧。\n我并没有把真珠星这个角色换成别人的打算哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "9569a4eeb352ebf791da973774ddcd45d59d47376f472c03ea2ca1eacc81dedb", "ja": "でも、そうか。\n星梨花は、演技のお仕事が楽しくなってきたんだな。", "zh": "不过，这样啊。\n星梨花开始觉得演戏的工作有趣起来了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "10c95e80934436ffca4a6f49b3d9c889a6256c43156e098d8a63db618a8f79c6", "ja": "はい！\nまだ上手じゃないですけど、とっても楽しいです！", "zh": "是！\n虽然还演得不太好，但我觉得特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "1a89a16a2af4e58aa0ca077879ccd944dc51f5daa0a369be37e9d2b3eb0ef8da", "ja": "その……鞠音を演じた時に、怖いとか、冷たいとか、\n今までとは違う感想をもらえました。", "zh": "那个……演鞠音的时候，我收到了“很可怕”“很冷淡”之类和以前不一样的评价。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "09aff6b95d5158071849ecae509701838416bf524985a1431efaab9855b36df4", "ja": "わたし、それがとってもうれしかったんです。\nちゃんとお芝居できてた、ってことですから。", "zh": "我感到非常开心。\n因为这说明我演得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "4d35077b3a09efaa52ca95c552e5d6d33907edef6e64cea89afec1a9dbe9f5b2", "ja": "うん。いつもの星梨花とは違う印象を\n見る人に与えたからこそだな。", "zh": "嗯。正是因为你给观众留下了\n不同于平时星梨花的印象啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "a3b2ea1c7d202521d60c6277fe0b01cf0890eccc2180724fd54933a7c9b9d7f3", "ja": "お芝居って、すごいんですね。\nわたしも知らないわたしになれるんだって……。", "zh": "演戏真是太厉害了。\n原来我也能成为一个连自己都不了解的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1039_022ser", "source_sha256": "7e01b859705e3f7f9b892e63b20f1b38c1a00d3a4896fc8f5af0ba75171271ce", "ja": "わたし、また新しいわたしに出会ってみたいんです。\nだから……難しいかもしれないけど、挑戦したいです！", "zh": "我还想再遇见一个全新的自己。\n所以……虽然可能会很难，但我想挑战一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "827eee5cd859625f4f40d365163f1e8ea3d4d70894e9d1dd4b48c2a2d02f5dc2", "ja": "{$P$}さん……時間はかかるかも\nしれませんけど、どうか見守っていてください！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……可能会花些时间，但请一定要守望着我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "5059c50a15c5a85d76ee0d0d16d424fd64734decddb5f2a3f202e6a221b8d6a3", "ja": "もちろんだ！\nそのためのスケジュール調整だからな。", "zh": "那是当然！\n为此我才调整了日程啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0333_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0333_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "eb76070c247ad5f8025344ee8104838a2e284327e1790109905df725cd43037e", "ja": "（星梨花の演じる真珠星、思った以上のものになる\nかもしれない……ここから先も、目が離せないな）", "zh": "（星梨花饰演的珍珠星，或许会比想象中更加出色……接下来也不能移开视线了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
